roup Policy Object (GPO) - Microsoft Software Restriction Policies (SRP) Monitoring and Logging: - Splunk - OSQuery - Wazuh (open-source SIEM and XDR) - EDRs Inventory Management and Auditing: - OSQuery - Wazuh"
